294	
295	Table~\ref{tab:cross_attack_k2} reports early detection on unseen attacks. At $K$\,=\,2, DisPeD achieves recall of 0.78 on FITD and 0.81 on Deceptive Delight, versus 0.55 and 0.58 for the baseline.
